  "notes": "Labels use GPIO names with the silkscreen name and CircuitPython name (Dn) first in functions; Power Domain tags (RTC, CPU) omitted, as are battery +/- polarity symbols. ADC names printed with a space (ADC2 CH3), copied as printed. Top pad of the left power header has no callout and no silkscreen (unlabeled, kept as \"?\"). MicroSD slot callouts (MISO/MOSI/SCK/SD_CS) describe a card socket, not wiring points; skipped. JTAG 2x5 header has no pin labels; skipped. DC jack, ON/OFF switch, RESET and Boot buttons, NeoPixel and LEDs skipped."
